      "side": 1,
      "message": "Q: What if we spawn a non-protected VM under protected ? Why don\u0027t we account for shared memory in this case ? Maybe we want to check if the system is running under protected mode ?",
      "revId": "55d6c2cbfdac44b38a606e25c4329014ccdf7dae",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
