        "id": 1951687
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-21T11:27:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In that case, you can just check the entire vm footprint :-)\n\nThat\u0027s why it\u0027s called \"protected_shared\" It\u0027s like protected_but_shared. \n\nIt intends to make sure we don\u0027t leave things shared while they shouldn\u0027t.",
      "parentUuid": "fabcd511_fbf05e72",
      "revId": "55d6c2cbfdac44b38a606e25c4329014ccdf7dae",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e24c1676_af51e46b",
        "filename": "arch/arm64/kvm/hypercalls.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 386,
