        "id": 1942270
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-21T11:33:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As a user of this API I would expect to retrieve it in the same way for protectd/non-protected VMs without necessarily having a separate code path for non-protected.",
      "parentUuid": "c9a11005_ac61ee18",
      "revId": "55d6c2cbfdac44b38a606e25c4329014ccdf7dae",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
